Q: Run go (golang) templ from VSCode task A: <p>If you put everything in the <code>command</code> string, VS Code treats it as a raw shell command. In your case it treats is like separate binaries and try execute it separately.<br />
Instead your syntax try it like this one:</p>
<pre class="lang-json prettyprint-override"><code>{
    &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.0.0&quot;,
    &quot;tasks&quot;: [
        {
            &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Templ Build&quot;,
            &quot;type&quot;: &quot;shell&quot;,
            &quot;command&quot;: &quot;go tool templ generate&quot;,
            &quot;problemMatcher&quot;: [
                &quot;$go&quot;
            ],
            &quot;group&quot;: &quot;build&quot;
        }
    ]
}
</code></pre>
